["<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #9ad4ff;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">壹</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">天枢</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">贪狼 · DUHBE · α</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">北斗之枢、群星引航的第一颗，象征智慧与进取。紫微中对应贪狼，善谋断、富野心，是开创者头顶的北极指针。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>智慧 · 开创</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌事业开创</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title\">文章待发布</span><a data-v-f40b3066=\"\" href=\"/blog/\" class=\"dp-go\">飞往查看 <b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">→</b></a></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #7de8c0;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">贰</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">天璇</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">巨门 · MERAK · β</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">与天枢连成指极线，永久指向北极。象义巨门，善辨析、重谋略，口才与洞察并重，是运筹帷幄的谋士之才。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>口才 · 洞察</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌沟通辨析</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title\">文章待发布</span><a data-v-f40b3066=\"\" href=\"/blog/\" class=\"dp-go\">飞往查看 <b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">→</b></a></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #ffc25e;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">叁</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">天玑</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">禄存 · PHECDA · γ</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">积蓄而发、厚积薄成，象义禄存，主财富与安稳。脚踏实地之人居此，往往越积越丰、基业长青。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>财富 · 务实</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌财富积累</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title\">文章待发布</span><a data-v-f40b3066=\"\" href=\"/blog/\" class=\"dp-go\">飞往查看 <b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">→</b></a></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #6ad7ff;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">肆</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">天权</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">文曲 · MEGREZ · δ</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">斗身与斗柄之间的枢纽，象义文曲。寓意文章得天之助，主聪明才学，是读书人、创作者的文昌照命。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>才学 · 文思</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌学业才华</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title\">文章待发布</span><a data-v-f40b3066=\"\" href=\"/blog/\" class=\"dp-go\">飞往查看 <b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">→</b></a></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #ff9d76;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">伍</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">玉衡</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">廉贞 · ALIOTH · ε</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">北斗中最亮的一颗，象义廉贞。气质孤高、行事干净，重原则、讲格调，一诺千金、不假辞色。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>果断 · 清廉</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌决断格调</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc nil\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag null\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title dim\">未完待续…</span></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-active dip-swap-enter-to\" style=\"--ec: #b39dff;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">陆</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">开阳</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">武曲 · MIZAR · ζ</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">近旁总伴一颗辅星，象义武曲。主刚毅执着、执行力超群，认定之事便一路打到底，是最可靠的定盘星。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>刚毅 · 沉稳</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌执行力</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc nil\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag null\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title dim\">未完待续…</span></div></div>","<div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-card dip-swap-enter-from dip-swap-enter-active\" style=\"--ec: #ff98c8;\"><header data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-head\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-big\">柒</span><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-titles\"><h3 data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-name\">摇光</h3><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-pos\">破军 · ALKAID · η</span></div></header><p data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-brief\">斗柄之末、指针的尽头，象义破军。破而后立、敢为天下先，是冲锋者与破局者最偏爱的锋芒。</p><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-parts\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">象征</b>变革 · 开创</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-tag alt\"><b data-v-f40b3066=\"\">主宰</b>主掌冲锋破局</span></div><div data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc nil\"><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-tag null\">DOC</span><span data-v-f40b3066=\"\" class=\"dp-doc-title dim\">未完待续…</span></div></div>"]